  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. With code signing for IoT, you can sign code that you create for any IoT device that is supported by Amazon Web Services (AWS). Code signing is available through Amazon FreeRTOS and AWS IoT Device Management, and integrated with AWS Certificate Manager (ACM).",
